Cell["Conclusion", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.74788516939583*^9, 
  3.7478851896728497`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"55db5fb8-566e-44d3-bd80-\
3e0f133ea9cf"],

Cell["\<\
We can see that the result depend on the label here, keep in mind that we \
didn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t take all the learning data in account, and that we \
have reduced the size of the images.

We could have to explore other kind of probability density function computed \
from the learning data set

But at the end for a very naive way to classify, we get interesting results.

And we can see that our features are not independent, the positions of \
adjacent pixels seem to follow a difficult to grasp law \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747885701115284*^9, 
  3.747885924870987*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2a6cc08f-225c-434d-8deb-\
12540d90d248"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
